# Bot1 takes Bot2's Lamplight Phoenix with Act of Treason and kills it with a Lightning Strike. The trigger is Bot1's, who
# controlled the Phoenix as it died (CR 603.3a); the card goes to its owner's graveyard (CR 400.3), and Bot1 may still exile
# it there, with Act of Treason and the Strike from Bot1's own graveyard as evidence (CR 701.59a). "Return this card to the
# battlefield" names no controller, so it enters under the control of Bot1, the player the effect has put it there (CR 110.2a).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Act of Treason
Lightning Strike
Mountain
Mountain x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Lamplight Phoenix
Island x18

